</i>Speed ≥ 1 Gb/s</span>
<span>
<i class=\\"vmFpSwatch vmFpSwatch--slow\\">
</i>Speed 10–100 Mb/s</span>
</div>
<div class=\\"euiSpacer euiSpacer--s\\">
</div>
</div>
</div>"
`;

